{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52520","headline":"其四 · 陈元光","name":"其四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"望望龙湖上，鱼龙薄汉云。\n鸿蒙开半月，蛇秽破孤军。\n一监生风翰，千章涣浪纹。\n法慈敷教化，清静加弥纶。\n法慈剪凶丑，凛冽回春温。\n龙湖三五夜，棨戟四回轮。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52520.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52520","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}